    <sys:String x:Key="About_Credits">Credits</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About_CreditsText">Inspired by the open-source FluentFlyout project; AuraFlyout is written independently of it. System status, device batteries and the speed test come from TaskbarStatus, TaskbarLogiBattery and TaskbarSpeedTest by the same author; all three are part of AuraFlyout now. Built with WPF-UI, CommunityToolkit.Mvvm and NAudio (MIT); CPU temperature through the PawnIO driver and its signed modules (LGPL-2.1). The speed test uses Cloudflare&apos;s servers, lyrics come from lrclib.net.</sys:String>
